<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title></title>
<style>
:root{ --bg:#f7f6f9;--panel:#ffffff;--ink:#1d1a17;--muted:#6b6259;--line:#e2dad0;--accent:#b4522a;--warn-bg:#fff6e8;--warn-line:#e8c88a;--ink-on:#1d1a17;--l0:90%;--drop:30%;--grey:hsl(0 0% 85%)}
@media (prefers-color-scheme:dark){:root{ --bg:#16151a;--panel:#1e1d23;--ink:#eceaf2;--muted:#a29caf;--line:#332f3b;--accent:#ff9a6a;--warn-bg:#2b2313;--warn-line:#6d5722;--fatal-bg:#2e1616;--fatal-line:#7a3232;--ink-on:#eceaf2;--l0:34%;--drop:-12%;--grey:hsl(0 0% 32%)}}
body{margin:0;padding:16px;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font:13px/1.45 system-ui,sans-serif}
h1{font-size:16px;margin:0 0 4px}h2{font-size:14px;margin:20px 0 6px}
.meta{color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 10px}
.warn{background:var(--warn-bg);border:1px solid var(--warn-line);padding:6px 10px;margin:6px 0;border-radius:4px}
.legend{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px 16px;align-items:center;margin:8px 0;color:var(--muted)}
.legend span.kv{display:inline-flex;gap:6px;align-items:center}
.sw{display:inline-block;width:14px;height:14px;border:1px solid var(--line);box-sizing:border-box}
.ramp{display:inline-block;width:120px;height:12px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:linear-gradient(90deg,hsl(215 75% calc(var(--l0) - var(--drop))),var(--grey),hsl(5 75% calc(var(--l0) - var(--drop))))}
.icicle{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);padding:2px;overflow-x:auto}
.n{box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;min-width:0;overflow:hidden}
.kids{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;width:100%}
.b{box-sizing:border-box;height:18px;margin:0 0 1px;padding:0;border:0;overflow:hidden;font-size:11px;line-height:18px;color:var(--ink-on);
background:hsl(var(--h,0) calc(var(--t,0)*75%) calc(var(--l0) - var(--t,0)*var(--drop)))}
.b.share-none,.b.share-same{background:var(--grey)}
.b.only-base{background-image:repeating-linear-gradient(45deg,rgb(0 0 0/.35) 0 2px,transparent 2px 6px)}
.b.only-new{outline:2px solid var(--ink);outline-offset:-2px}
.b.ambiguous{outline:2px dashed var(--accent);outline-offset:-2px}
.b.not-comparable{box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 2px var(--accent);font-style:italic}
.l{display:block;padding:0 4px;overflow:hidden;white-space:nowrap;text-overflow:ellipsis}
table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;background:var(--panel)}
th,td{border:1px solid var(--line);padding:3px 8px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top}
td.num{font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;white-space:nowrap}
.empty{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);padding:12px;margin:12px 0}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1></h1>
<p class="meta">base <span title="891132b92a6ac5299fbf52b1cb95fc7f8a4f8c07d04354077e4471c128e9b17b">cpu.pb.gz</span>: 1000 nanoseconds (1.00 µs) &middot; new <span title="4d7ef9338356ea80fa517ff55e1052f93af7bfed0c886daac2e2317525810541">new.pb.gz</span>: 1000 nanoseconds (1.00 µs)</p>
<p class="meta">perturbation: comparison unavailable: not a GPU view</p>



<div class="legend">
<span class="kv">lower share <span class="ramp"></span> higher share: lower / higher share of total cpu (nanoseconds); full colour = &plusmn;11.10 points of share</span>
<span class="kv"><span class="sw" style="background:var(--grey)"></span> share unavailable or unchanged</span>
<span class="kv"><span class="sw" style="background-image:repeating-linear-gradient(45deg,rgb(0 0 0/.35) 0 2px,transparent 2px 6px)"></span> only in base</span>
<span class="kv"><span class="sw" style="outline:2px solid var(--ink);outline-offset:-2px"></span> only in new</span>
<span class="kv"><span class="sw" style="box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 2px var(--accent)"></span> not comparable (! marker, reason on hover)</span>
<span class="kv"><span class="sw" style="outline:2px dashed var(--accent);outline-offset:-2px"></span> ambiguous match</span>
</div>
<p class="meta">Width is base plus new nanoseconds of a node over the root's. Colour is the change in the node's share of its own view's total; hover a node for the raw change in nanoseconds.</p>
<div class="icicle"><div class="n" style="width:100.0000%"><div class="b share-same" style="--h:0;--t:0" title="all
base 1000 nanoseconds (1.00 µs), new 1000 nanoseconds (1.00 µs)
change &#43;0 nanoseconds (0 ns)
change in share of own total &#43;0.00 points
base id e3b0c44298fc1c14, new id e3b0c44298fc1c14
presence both"><span class="l">all</span></div><div class="kids"><div class="n" style="width:100.0000%"><div class="b share-same" style="--h:0;--t:0" title="main
base 1000 nanoseconds (1.00 µs), new 1000 nanoseconds (1.00 µs)
change &#43;0 nanoseconds (0 ns)
change in share of own total &#43;0.00 points
base id 6d8817fb4e98e681, new id d904d484ce202f8f
presence both, matched by_name"><span class="l">main</span></div><div class="kids"><div class="n" style="width:45.5500%"><div class="b share-lower" style="--h:215;--t:1.000" title="a
base 511 nanoseconds (511 ns), new 400 nanoseconds (400 ns)
change -111 nanoseconds (-111 ns)
change in share of own total -11.10 points
base id 50666367c7698688, new id 52dd0e81451e02e1
presence both, matched by_name"><span class="l">a</span></div><div class="kids"><div class="n" style="width:78.0461%"><div class="b share-lower" style="--h:215;--t:1.000" title="b
base 411 nanoseconds (411 ns), new 300 nanoseconds (300 ns)
change -111 nanoseconds (-111 ns)
change in share of own total -11.10 points
base id 19f8d19ed72f72ff, new id 8c9e70bcc668c609
presence both, matched by_name"><span class="l">b</span></div></div></div></div><div class="n" style="width:5.5500%"><div class="b share-higher only-new" style="--h:5;--t:1.000" title="d
base 0 nanoseconds (0 ns), new 111 nanoseconds (111 ns)
change &#43;111 nanoseconds (&#43;111 ns)
change in share of own total &#43;11.10 points
new id 9183709297ca2e71
presence only_new"><span class="l">d</span></div></div><div class="n" style="width:48.9000%"><div class="b share-same" style="--h:0;--t:0" title="c
base 489 nanoseconds (489 ns), new 489 nanoseconds (489 ns)
change &#43;0 nanoseconds (0 ns)
change in share of own total &#43;0.00 points
base id dc7211ebcac6e9c7, new id 0399502155f5d9e5
presence both, matched by_name"><span class="l">c</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>

<h2>Removed and added paths</h2>
<p class="meta">Absence from one side does not prove the cost was eliminated or introduced: the frame may be unresolved, renamed, inlined or sampled out there. Only the topmost path of each one-sided subtree is listed.</p>
<table>
<tr><th>Path</th><th>Side</th><th>Change</th><th>Interpretation</th><th>Why</th></tr>
<tr><td>all &gt; main &gt; d</td><td>only_new</td><td class="num">&#43;111 nanoseconds (&#43;111 ns)</td><td>comparable</td><td></td></tr>
</table>



</body>
</html>

